6046       ;
6047       title 'Beaton/Tukey Biweight Robust Regression using IRLS';
6048       proc nlin data=uspop nohalve;
6049       parms b0=20450.43 b1=-22.7806 b2=.0063456;
6050       model pop=b0+b1*year+b2*year*year;
6051       resid = pop-model.pop;
6052       sigma = 2;
6053       k = 4.685;
6054       if abs(resid/sigma)<=k then _weight_=(1-(resid / (sigma*k))**2)**2;
6055       else _weight_=0;
6056       output out=c r=rbi;
6057       run;

NOTE: DER.b0 not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
NOTE: DER.b1 not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
NOTE: DER.b2 not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
NOTE: Convergence criterion met.
